    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4d78f1db01ccff0eb8ab0843",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "那时候我装了什么傻。\n又或者是否有装傻。\n都随着波涛声消逝了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3c271aa25e3fd078e67bfb5648d0b53b4b1af32b3b452e31d4daf018a24ed914",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1130/storytimeline_501130111.json",
      "json_path": [
