      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "芜～～！！　这次的比赛也超赞呀！！\n杏目和旺紫丁都参加的比赛一场也不能落！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6c4048112a9a09761727573320a363285b5d3014ec158af8e7b402b2382f238e",
