      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我真的好喜欢旺紫丁啊～。\n和杏这样的超级巨星同台竞技，\n一直一副“女王”范儿好帅呀……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a1f715c221b8c8b4dd75717ba05f5c0a42a061e1f60f4b3fbea92612de6a43eb",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1130/storytimeline_501130111.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
